WEBVTT

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:02.750
Nine hundred pages.

00:00:02.770 --> 00:00:05.840
One question: what format does the export use?

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:08.570
Two seconds later: CSV!

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:09.870
Mic drop.

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:11.630
It read forty pages.

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:15.710
Page six hundred twelve says JSON.

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:22.430
Long Read reads toward your question, inside a budget you set.

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:28.260
You can see exactly what it read, and what it skipped.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:34.030
Answers come with the passage, the page, and the line.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:41.330
Out of budget?

00:00:41.420 --> 00:00:42.690
It marks its place.

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:46.310
New edition?

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:48.780
It won’t pretend nothing changed.

00:00:59.210 --> 00:00:59.880
Long Read.

00:01:00.130 --> 00:01:01.560
Read toward a question.

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:03.850
Keep the evidence and the gaps.
